# No exception needed for a template's own registry config (e.g. scoped
# @colidevs mapping for @colidevs/utils, D4): verified directly against this
# project's own `pnpm pack` that `.npmrc` is unconditionally stripped from a
# published package, regardless of `files` globs, .npmignore, or any
# .gitignore negation — no override is possible (found during
# kumo-console-template Phase 5's registration). A template needing one
# ships it as `.npmrc.template` instead and `index.ts`'s `restoreNpmrcFiles`
# renames it back at scaffold time — see that function's own comment.
# `.npmrc.template` isn't matched by this bare `.npmrc` pattern, so it needs
# no exception here.